===== Building OpenWrt =====

Suitable U-Boot can be found under Boot Loaders -> uboot-lantiq-arv7510pw_nor/ram (works also with ARV4510PW). NOR-version will be installed to flash, RAM-version can be used with the UART boot option.

Following patches for Barrier Breaker (14.07) are needed:
   * [[http://www.elisanet.fi/malaakso/misc/lantiq_mei.patch|Improve memory usage of ADSL driver]] Prevent out-of-memory errors when loading ADSL firmware.
   * [[http://www.elisanet.fi/malaakso/misc/disable_jffs2_lzma.patch|Disable LZMA compression in JFFS2]] Workaround bug [[https://dev.openwrt.org/ticket/14839|#14839]].
   * [[http://www.elisanet.fi/malaakso/misc/disable-buffered.patch|Disable buffered writes to flash]] Prevent jffs2 corruption.

Pre-built Barrier Breaker (14.07) image (includes luci and kmod-ath5k):
   * [[http://www.elisanet.fi/malaakso/misc/openwrt-lantiq-xway-ARV4510PW-squashfs.image|OpenWrt image]]
Pre-built U-Boot:
   * [[http://www.elisanet.fi/malaakso/misc/openwrt-lantiq-arv7510pw_nor-u-boot.img|NOR-version]]
   * [[http://www.elisanet.fi/malaakso/misc/openwrt-lantiq-arv7510pw_ram-u-boot.asc|RAM-version]]

Official OpenWrt 14.07 images for [[https://downloads.openwrt.org/barrier_breaker/14.07/lantiq/xway/|lantiq xway]] do not work due to missing patch for disabling buffered writes. Trunk and Chaos Calmer (15.05) should work without extra patches since r44451.

